{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美高梅中國上半年業績倒退。純利19億元，按年下跌百分之20.2。派中期息每股0.25元，減少約兩成。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內經營收入則上升百分之4.3，至接近174億元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T17:02:13.220923+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":76,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}